marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="FFFFFF"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Every privileged action becomes a permanent row</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="19" name="Text 17"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="868680" y="4754880"/><a:ext cx="5212080" cy="1508760"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1050" i="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F4E9D8"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Whenever an admin verifies a crime, edits a user, or uploads a FIR, we write a row to the audit_logs table — capturing who did it, when, from which IP, and what changed. There is no UPDATE or DELETE path on this table by design — once written, the record stays, so any tampering is obvious.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1050" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="20" name="Shape 18"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6355080" y="3950208"/><a:ext cx="5349240" cy="2377440"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="121C3A"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="9525"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2A3A6E"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id=